# Monitor commands on which MAME's m68030 and the core are known to answer
# differently (doc/m14-mismatches.md): not in `make sun3x`'s set. Run with
#   CMDS=sim/mame/mmu.cmds make sun3x
# which fails on the differences and shows them.
#
# Open the page map entry of a PROM page (m14-b1: PTEST's address register).
p fefe0000
q
# ... of the Ethernet controller's page.
p fef82000
q
# The interrupt stack pointer at the monitor's entry.
r
q
# Boot from the Ethernet: the probe of the LANCE (m14-b2).
b le()
